# Organization Management SaaS — Agent Rules
# Refer to CLAUDE.md for the complete development standards.

- Four-Layer Tenant Isolation (MySQL 8.0/InnoDB): Edge middleware -> AsyncLocalStorage -> Prisma Tenant Extension -> organizationId composite indexes.
- Dual-track permissions: Membership Tier (Associate->General->Life) independent of Organizational Positions (President, GS, etc.).
- Guards sequence: TenantGuard -> PermissionGuard(resource, action) -> ScopeInterceptor (branch subtree).
- Unlimited Branch Hierarchy: Materialized path ("1/4/12") + Adjacency list (parentId). Moving node rewrites all descendants atomically.
- Money: Integer paisa (BigInt). No floats. Idempotency keys mandatory.
- Bilingual: English + বাংলা equal citizens. No hardcoded strings. Dual fields (name/nameBn).
- Design Standard: Zero AI slop. Lenis smooth scroll + GSAP 3 + Framer Motion + Three.js 3D branch constellation & holographic ID card.
- Quality gates: Vertical slices. Schema -> Guards -> UI -> Boundary tests (Tenant B & Branch isolation). No `any`, no TODO placeholders.
